<p>
    All of my furmeet photos are released under the
    <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/" target="_blank">CC BY-NC-ND</a> licence.
</p>
<p class="fineprint">
    This means you are free to repost my photos without asking me, so long as you leave them unedited and attribute them to me. Leaving the watermark uncropped is sufficient attribution, but tagging me on any social platform I'm on is also appreciated.
</p>
<p>
    If you wish to license a photo for commercial use, or would like an unwatermarked version for personal printing, please email me:
</p>

<nav aria-label="Email Me" class="mb-3">
    <a class="button" href="mailto:photos@crittery.me?subject=Photo Request" title="Email photos@crittery.me">
        <i aria-hidden="true">@@</i>
        <span>Email</span>
    </a>
</nav>